{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Let's Learn Janggi (Korean Chess)",
    "steam_appid": 1597900,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597900/extras/26267e7e9e606ab710b6520577f7f547.webp?t=1621792375\" /></div><br>Learn the traditional Korean game of Janggi. <br>Examine all aspects of the ancient strategy game, including the Korean names of important game elements.<br>Learn with interactive training boards and challenge yourself with endgame puzzles.<br>Study piece movements, checkmate conditions and tactics; learn Janggi inside out!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597900/extras/2aa14fe83666e74ffa6525dfb4e4d6c8.webp?t=1621792375\" /></div><br>Play against a wide variety of AI opponents, choosing a difficulty to match your skill level.<br>In-game indicators provide helpful reminders of each piece's available movements, letting you focus on choosing the best move.<br>As you improve, dial up the difficulty to ensure a stimulating strategic challenge.<br>Try playing with a handicap to test your skills to the limit!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597900/extras/6e8f36f7436af755f3ede5c1a6d3197c.webp?t=1621792375\" /></div><br>Once you've learned the basics, why not enter the Janggi leagues?<br>Choose from the Daejeon, Gwangju, Busan and Seoul leagues. Each league has a variety of AI opponents to challenge you at every level.<br>To progress through the leagues, you'll develop your technique and employ a wide range of Janggi tactics.<br>With a sound strategy, victory can be yours.<br><br>Are you ready? Let's learn Janggi!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597900/extras/26267e7e9e606ab710b6520577f7f547.webp?t=1621792375\" /></div><br>Learn the traditional Korean game of Janggi. <br>Examine all aspects of the ancient strategy game, including the Korean names of important game elements.<br>Learn with interactive training boards and challenge yourself with endgame puzzles.<br>Study piece movements, checkmate conditions and tactics; learn Janggi inside out!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597900/extras/2aa14fe83666e74ffa6525dfb4e4d6c8.webp?t=1621792375\" /></div><br>Play against a wide variety of AI opponents, choosing a difficulty to match your skill level.<br>In-game indicators provide helpful reminders of each piece's available movements, letting you focus on choosing the best move.<br>As you improve, dial up the difficulty to ensure a stimulating strategic challenge.<br>Try playing with a handicap to test your skills to the limit!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597900/extras/6e8f36f7436af755f3ede5c1a6d3197c.webp?t=1621792375\" /></div><br>Once you've learned the basics, why not enter the Janggi leagues?<br>Choose from the Daejeon, Gwangju, Busan and Seoul leagues. Each league has a variety of AI opponents to challenge you at every level.<br>To progress through the leagues, you'll develop your technique and employ a wide range of Janggi tactics.<br>With a sound strategy, victory can be yours.<br><br>Are you ready? Let's learn Janggi!",
    "short_description": "Study piece movements, checkmate conditions and tactics; learn Janggi inside out! Solve endgame puzzles and play against AI opponents, perfecting your Janggi strategy.",
